#### Functional requirements

* Users can CRUD Groups/Chats
* 100 users per chat
* A user sends a message every 10 seconds
* CRUD on messages - Pagination
* Streaming messages

#### Non functional requirements

* Message creation SLO - 100ms
* (Paginated) List Messages SLO - 250ms
* Freshness - 500ms
* Scalable, Available, Eventually Consistent
* Global Usage


#### Out of Scope

* Typing indicator?
* Compliance, Filtering etc